  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="61">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 61</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And we forbeodað on Godes forbode, þæt nan man na ma wifa næbbe buton I; 7 seo beo mid rihte beweddod 7 forgifen;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And by virtue of God's prohibition we forbid that any man should have more wives than one; and she is to be legally betrothed and wedded;</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">And on account of God's prohibition, we forbid any man to have more than one wife, and she is to be properly promised and wed.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
